"background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41":{"type":"Kit-Contents","blocks":{"template--18766227767614__87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41-1682513152ad3c7e0c-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Kit Contents","heading_size":"h1"}},"template--18766227767614__87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41-1682513152ad3c7e0c-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>1 brush head <br\/>1 Super Brush body <br\/>1 travel case <br\/>1 charging stand with wire <br\/>1 adapter<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--18766227767614__87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41-1682513152ad3c7e0c-0","template--18766227767614__87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41-1682513152ad3c7e0c-1"],"settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.kit_contents_image.value }}","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","settings":{"heading":"You may also like","heading_size":"h2","products_to_show":3,"columns_desktop":3,"color_scheme":"background-1","image_ratio":"square","show_secondary_image":true,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"enable_quick_add":true,"columns_mobile":"1","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":24}},"1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2":{"type":"faqs-product","blocks":{"template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-0":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is the difference between an electric toothbrush and a sonic toothbrush?","row_content":"<p>Electric toothbrushes vibrate at between 2,500-7,500 strokes per minute whereas sonic toothbrushes vibrate at above 24,000 strokes per minute! 10 times more vibrations per minute means at least 5 times more plaque removal, leaving you feeling cleaner than ever.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is the SuperBrush really a sonic toothbrush?","row_content":"<p>Yes, your SuperBrush is made with TRUE sonic technology. How’s that, you ask? Across our three smart modes, the SuperBrush cycles between vibrations ranging from 24,000-33,000 strokes per minute - perfectly mimicking a clean-up at the dentist. Less visits to the dentist for you!<\/p>","page":""}},"template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How often do I need to charge my SuperBrush?","row_content":"<p>This is our favourite question. One overnight charge of 10 hours gives you a battery life of *drumroll* 60 DAYS (brushing being twice a day). This means you only need to charge your SuperBrush 6 times a year! <\/p>","page":""}},"template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Why are the SuperBrush bristles shaped like that?","row_content":"<p>The SuperBrush is made of soft DuPont bristles. They are uniquely W shaped to adapt to your teeth perfectly and clean all the spaces between your teeth. <\/p>","page":""}},"bfb86046-1475-46ca-95ff-3bdf3fd8d730":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Why is the brush head smaller than my regular toothbrush?","row_content":"<p>Studies have shown that the last teeth are most prone to cavities because most brush heads don’t clean there effectively. The small head shape of the SuperBrush is designed to go into the tightest spaces of your mouth for that super deep clean.<\/p>","page":""}},"99d23468-7c5b-4688-9e8d-597faaf71117":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How long is the warranty on the SuperBrush?","row_content":"<p>We’ve got you covered! Your SuperBrush comes with a warranty of 1 year, make sure you register your warranty within 30 days of buying your SuperBrush for it to be valid.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-0","template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-1","template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-2","template--18766227767614__1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2-1682574566f86a5269-3","bfb86046-1475-46ca-95ff-3bdf3fd8d730","99d23468-7c5b-4688-9e8d-597faaf71117"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Still got questions?","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"background-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":24}},"6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88":{"type":"testimonial-sec","blocks":{"template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Never ever had fresher breath in my life!","text":"<p>I never really thought about brushing too much and then I saw this pink brush and it’s so beautiful I had to buy it! It is my first time using an electric toothbrush and I like the moon mode the most. My teeth also feel much cleaner and I have less bad breath than before. Definitely recommend this to everyone!<\/p>","link_label":"Karishhma M,","link_label1":"Delhi","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_1.1.jpg","link":""}},"template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Love that I can happily brush in the shower!","text":"<p>I have used an electric toothbrush before but this one is a complete game changer - I have the black one and I can happily brush in the shower because I’m always running late. It’s actually waterproof and I can be super lazy because it has a 2min timer so I brush till the timer goes off.  Best buy ever!<\/p>","link_label":"Nikhil M,","link_label1":"Mumbai","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_2.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/the-sonic-toothbrush-carbon-edition"}},"template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"60 days battery life is a game changer.","text":"<p>My dentist advised me to use an electric toothbrush because I have bleeding gums. I tried many and then always stopped using it because I kept forgetting to charge it. This 60 day battery life has totally sorted me out because I don’t need to carry my charger even when I travel. My teeth and gums are sensitive. I'm enjoying the last mode the most because it feels nice and not very harsh.<\/p>","link_label":"Harshali T,","link_label1":"Chennai","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_3.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/the-sonic-toothbrush-lavender-edition"}},"ddbb9f40-4327-4c93-a4df-83b3099454b0":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Cutest matching mint brush and travel case - and super hygienic!","text":"<p>For someone who would totally skip her night brushing because of crazy work hours to now waiting to brush with my new mint sonic toothbrush, I’m enjoying my oral care as much as skincare. I feel like my teeth are actually looking less yellow and feel much cleaner. And how cute is that matching travel case with it! <\/p>","link_label":"Vedd R,","link_label1":"Bangalore","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_4.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/the-sonic-toothbrush-summer-mint-edition"}}},"block_order":["template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-0","template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-1","template--19253175189789__6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88-1686316221f3f2a604-2","ddbb9f40-4327-4c93-a4df-83b3099454b0"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Can’t stop smiling :)","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["main","68dd5069-6bc3-4672-80e4-ea37693e3990","judgeme_section_review_widget_3ce2","ad82d2a2-a18f-4f5f-85a9-1be61437f81c","ee711da0-04f5-45bb-ae7e-ffd1aae8d1ba","523f4ea7-c910-4501-b304-8c86283166b9","6047b8b3-34a5-42c3-bb97-921febd7b9fc","5043dbda-7baf-4890-94c9-91e506cd3f1a","bb0758e3-208a-4a1a-b64c-f7edc30e894c","df5fc677-0f44-43e5-b44e-cc50011c71d0","87ebba87-8821-45b0-9e52-a2828023da41","related-products","1a223cb3-a359-46c4-8c33-a9b3365dcfa2","6286ee22-9f03-4647-845c-4aa7c0a04e88"]}